<title>SINGAPORE: DBS Bank to list 73,100 new shares.</title>
<headline>DBS Bank to list 73,100 new shares.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Singapore Ltd (SES) said on Tuesday that an additional 73,100 ordinary shares in the Development Bank of Singapore Ltd (DBS) would be listed and quoted on Wednesday.</p>
<p>SES said in a statement the listing of the Singapore $1.00 shares followed the conversion of 377,000 non-redeemable convertible preference shares.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703011)</p>
</text>
